Howfrag - (PD) 1991 Russell HoffmanFeel free to copy and distribute this program so long as there is nocharge associated with it other than a minimal media fee.This program will tell you the fragmentation status of any file or files.Simply type howfrag <files> and it will give a fragmentation report foreach file. Useful for determining when it is soon time to re-copy filesthat get added to frequently.-? gives helpRussell Hoffmanrh2y+@andrew.cmu.eduCarnegie Mellon University